t(5,"common","Common-size cash flow statement","Each item as a percentage of revenue, or each inflow as a percentage of total inflows and each outflow as a percentage of total outflows.")
t(5,"fcf","Free cash flow to the firm (FCFF)","Cash available to all capital providers, debt and equity.")
t(5,"fcf","Free cash flow to equity (FCFE)","Cash available to common shareholders after all obligations.")
