t(11,"ratio","Leverage ratios","Focus on the balance sheet: how much is financed with debt.")
t(11,"ratio","Coverage ratios","Focus on the income statement and cash flows: ability to service debt.")
t(11,"ratio","Higher debt-based leverage ratios","Higher financial risk and weaker solvency.")
